msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I'm writing an article about the executives of the Tojo Clan, but I'm "
"having a hard time gathering info..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "What kind of article?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm tryin' to get a bead on their life stories⑬how they got to where "
"they are today⑬that kind of thing. Mine's a tricky one, however..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Mine? Wasn't he just a regular stock broker or something before becoming a "
"yakuza? Info on him shouldn't be that hard to find..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Well, yeah, but I can't for the life of me figure out why he decided to go "
"down that path. I've looked all over for friends or relatives, but no one's "
"turned up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"(Come to think of it, Mine is a bit of a mystery. Daigo might know "
"something about him, but he's in no position to talk right now...)"
msgstr ""

